{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 76,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER076.YBC",
      "sha256": "d3d82b23020b80fff99703c0056668e7031597a93651c3d7dd14f57ae176819b",
      "text_count": 206,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 226,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1,
            2,
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "《一心一意地，那些孩子們，\n　現在好像發現了什麼目標而開始有所動作，\n　看著他們朝著自己的目標而努力的樣子，\n　應該沒有哪一位老師不會因此而感到欣慰的\n　吧。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 262,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6,
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "《然而在那之中，\n　也有壓抑著自己而在痛苦裡掙扎的身影。\n　過去都是被嚴格而有力地引導著，\n　所以在尋找自己的方向時，遇到了困難。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 298,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "《而瑟希莉絲這樣的心情，我感同身受。\n　在環顧四週的時候，因為不安而垂下雙眼。\n　心裡想著：\n　「現在不做點什麼事情的話是不行的。」》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 322,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "《看來，她正是因為找不到那可以實現的目標\n　而感到痛苦呀。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 392,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 430,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "不要太勉強自己了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 464,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 502,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "其他人是其他人，妳就是妳呀。\n妳也是為了重要的朋友們，\n才一路努力到了現在的地步。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 528,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 552,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "只要全心全意地去做自己想做的事情，\n那樣就可以了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 586,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "……但是，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 608,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 640,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "《很想弄清楚自己到底可以做些什麼事情，\n　少女的眼神筆直地往前方眺望。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 666,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 696,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            29,
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "《想要尋找自己能夠完成的事情，\n　所以才湧現了這樣的疑問嗎？\n　這個僅僅十五歲的少女。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 714,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 748,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 770,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "我，抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 804,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36,
            37
          ],
          "text": "抱著這樣心情的我，\n根本就沒有資格和正在全心全意奮鬥的大家一\n起努力吧……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 830,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 864,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "我已經不想再讓帕彌菈學姊失望了……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 892,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            40,
            41
          ],
          "text": "就算只有多一點也好，\n我也希望可以多瞭解羅沙麗亞學姊的心情……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 914,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "我想好好地去幫助夏朧……！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 940,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 974,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "還有，老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 996,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "我也想多瞭解一些有關於您的事情……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1022,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "瑟希莉絲……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1056,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "對不起，老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1094,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            48,
            49,
            50
          ],
          "text": "妳根本就不需要道歉呀。\n妳已經開始有所進步了，\n已經踏出了那重要的一步呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1128,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "重要的一步……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1166,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            52,
            53,
            54
          ],
          "text": "在朝霧之中迷失的時候，\n也許會在路邊邂逅新生枝芽的美麗，\n以及那露水滴落的光輝呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1200,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1244,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            56,
            57,
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "與妳分離，令我感覺很難過。\n妳的朋友們也一定是這麼想的吧。\n對妳來說，這又是多麼地痛苦呢。\n無論是要留在這裡也好，或是要離開也好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1274,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            60,
            61,
            62
          ],
          "text": "現在，妳似乎已經照著自己所說的話，\n用盡全力地要去尋找一件自己所要追求的事物\n了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1308,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1334,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1368,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "啊啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1396,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            66,
            67
          ],
          "text": "雖然在這樣的環境下，但有關自己究竟想要做\n些什麼，我卻一直都沒有任何概念。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1424,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            68,
            69
          ],
          "text": "可是，我覺得大家都已經這樣做了，\n所以我不這樣做是不行的呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1456,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            70,
            71
          ],
          "text": "我一直都希望被您誇獎，\n以被您誇獎為快樂，而努力到現在……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1484,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            72,
            73
          ],
          "text": "但如果是這樣的話，\n我豈不是完全都沒有改變……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1510,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1544,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1566,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "拜託您。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1588,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1610,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            78
          ],
          "text": "我想去瞭解更多的事物。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1660,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            79,
            80,
            81,
            82,
            83
          ],
          "text": "《回頭想想看，那些在愛爾梅納斯裡求學，\n　以成為賢者為目標而努力的孩子們；\n　我一直以為他們可以毫無疑惑地前進，\n　就算碰到了迷惑，也可以靠自己找到解答。\n　總是抱著這種想法的我，實在太天真了。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1686,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            84
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1704,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，這樣啊，的確是這樣呢……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1730,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1756,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "那麼妳有勇氣跟大家道別嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1790,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1840,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            89,
            90,
            91,
            92,
            93
          ],
          "text": "《連跟大家分別的勇氣都沒有，\n　又怎麼能找到屬於自己的使命呢？\n　然而……\n　如果阻止了那些要展開旅行的人們，\n　也會使他們感到痛苦吧。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1866,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            94
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1902,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            95,
            96,
            97,
            98
          ],
          "text": "《但如果不阻止要離開的人，\n　留下來的人也會感到痛苦呀。\n　我希望可以好好地去珍惜這種感覺，\n　還有這一顆心。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1944,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            99,
            100,
            101,
            102,
            103
          ],
          "text": "那就寫封信給大家吧，\n好好地感受自己的心情，把它化作文字，\n然後試著表達出來讓大家知道。\n無論在寫信的時候，還是妳出外旅行的時候，\n不管決心受到了怎樣的動搖。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 1968,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            104,
            105
          ],
          "text": "妳也一定要抬頭挺胸地走出去。\n妳的心意，我會幫妳傳達給大家的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2002,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            106
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2024,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            107
          ],
          "text": "非常感謝您。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2062,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            108,
            109,
            110
          ],
          "text": "不客氣。\n妳也教了我很重要的事情呀。\n妳的心靈與妳的話語，對我都有很大的影響。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2096,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            111
          ],
          "text": "老、師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2122,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            112
          ],
          "text": "謝謝。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2168,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            113
          ],
          "text": "……嗚。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2196,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            114,
            115
          ],
          "text": "想不到，嗚……\n想不到會有人這樣地跟我道謝……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2218,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            116
          ],
          "text": "這是第一次……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2244,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            117
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2270,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            118
          ],
          "text": "我很開心。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2292,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            119
          ],
          "text": "真的很開心。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2318,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            120
          ],
          "text": "……瑟希莉絲。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2358,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            121,
            122
          ],
          "text": "可是，嗚，我……\n卻要離開老師了……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2380,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            123
          ],
          "text": "我是笨蛋。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2402,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            124
          ],
          "text": "對不起……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2428,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            125
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2462,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            126
          ],
          "text": "……嗚。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2488,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            127
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2522,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            128
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2544,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            129
          ],
          "text": "我……一定會回來的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2582,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            130,
            131,
            132
          ],
          "text": "……嗯嗯。\n這是當然的，我會等著妳的。\n一直等下去。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2688,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            133
          ],
          "text": "請你們原諒我這樣不說一句話就走了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2716,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            134,
            135
          ],
          "text": "……法娜學姊、艾爾雪學姊，妳們真的都一向對我很好，\n都曾經讓我那麼地快樂。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2738,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            136
          ],
          "text": "還有一開始替我加油打氣的凱洛特，我也沒辦法忘記。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2760,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            137
          ],
          "text": "伊里安和奎絲忒做事，也是一直那麼地全心全意。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2788,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            138,
            139
          ],
          "text": "雖然希里鄔司說話總是莽撞了一點，\n但是他也總是傳達了一些我所不知道的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2820,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            140,
            141
          ],
          "text": "還有夏朧，因為妳坦率的個性，\n我不知道受到了多少的鼓勵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2854,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            142,
            143,
            144
          ],
          "text": "本來應該好好支持你們的我，\n卻在無形中，反而從處於痛苦中的你們身上，\n學到了許多事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2880,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            145
          ],
          "text": "就因為這樣，所以我覺得應該自己去尋找。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2902,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            146
          ],
          "text": "就因為你們曾經這麼努力的幫助我，所以我也想努力地報答你們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2930,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            147,
            148
          ],
          "text": "現在，我終於發現了，從過去到現在，對你們給予我的關懷，\n我竟然都沒有回應過。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2952,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            149
          ],
          "text": "我竟然連一句感謝的話都沒能對你們說。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2974,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            150
          ],
          "text": "雖然從今往後，我不知道究竟能追尋到什麼樣的事物。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 2996,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            151
          ],
          "text": "但是，這卻是我第一次感受到自己有這麼大的決心。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3022,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            152
          ],
          "text": "所以，請你們原諒我必須這樣沉默地離開。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3044,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            153
          ],
          "text": "也請你們不要責怪那沒有阻止我的老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3066,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            154
          ],
          "text": "我以後會好好努力的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3088,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            155
          ],
          "text": "然後，一定會再回到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3116,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            156,
            157
          ],
          "text": "雖然那個時候，不知道你們會不會再以笑容迎接我。\n但是，這一點我也已經有所覺悟了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3138,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            158
          ],
          "text": "因為我希望能夠能全心全意地跟大家在一起。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3164,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            159
          ],
          "text": "給我親愛的同伴們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3186,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            160
          ],
          "text": "給我真的，真的很珍視的朋友們呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3208,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            161
          ],
          "text": "我要離開了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3270,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            162
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3320,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            163
          ],
          "text": "唔嗯……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3382,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            164
          ],
          "text": "……是啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3450,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            165,
            166
          ],
          "text": "怎麼沒有留給帕彌菈學姊和羅沙麗亞學姊的話\n呢……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3504,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            167
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3566,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            168
          ],
          "text": "沒關係的，現在時機還沒有到。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3628,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            169
          ],
          "text": "咦？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3690,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            170
          ],
          "text": "那就是她這趟旅行所要找出的目標呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3712,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            171
          ],
          "text": "現在，就好好地祝福她吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3746,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            172
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3808,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            173
          ],
          "text": "……再見了，瑟希莉絲。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3930,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            174,
            175,
            176,
            177,
            178
          ],
          "text": "只不過是一夜之間，\n她心中究竟沉積了多少感受，\n又忍耐了多少痛苦呀。\n她一定會有所領悟的，而且，\n感受到了她的思念的伊諾森提雅也是。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3972,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            179
          ],
          "text": "真是令人羨慕耶。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 3998,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            180
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4048,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            181,
            182,
            183,
            184,
            185
          ],
          "text": "這世界上還是有像這樣的友情存在呀。\n什麼……\n「給我親愛的同伴們。\n給我真的，真的很珍視的朋友們呀。\n我要離開了。」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4074,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            186
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4118,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            187,
            188,
            189,
            190
          ],
          "text": "然後，「給對我說了發自內心話語的老師，\n我真的很珍視，真的很喜歡的老師。\n我要離開了。」\n……是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4160,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            191,
            192,
            193,
            194,
            195
          ],
          "text": "一直感覺不到自己可以被信賴的人，\n終於得到了別人的信賴，\n跟聽到別人說很喜歡自己的話比起來，\n究竟哪一個會比較快樂呢？\n你呀，是不是也覺得她變得比較率直了呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4186,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            196
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，我也這麼認為。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4230,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            197,
            198,
            199,
            200
          ],
          "text": "然而，啊啊……為了所愛的孩子，\n無論是多麼愚蠢的事情，都有可能做得出來，\n所謂為人父母的心情，\n大概說不定就是這樣吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4268,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            201,
            202,
            203
          ],
          "text": "是啊，連這麼幼小的她要離開，\n我竟然都沒有阻止。\n但是……我卻沒有任何可以阻止她的理由。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 76,
          "source_offset": 4300,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            204,
            205
          ],
          "text": "沒錯。\n唉呀，別擔心，至少還能幫她收屍啦。"
        }
      ],
